<title>USA: Martin Marietta names Zelnak vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Martin Marietta names Zelnak vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martin Marietta Materials Inc said Tuesday that Stephen Zelnak has been elected vice chairman of its board, in addition to his current posts as president and chief executive.</p>
</text>
